        <IRI>http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_15335</IRI>
        <Literal>Acacetin is a flavone, a type of plant-derived flavonoid compound, found in various plant species, including flowers and herbs. [Definition Source: llama3-8b-8192]</Literal>
