        <Literal>A shallow groove between the dentate gyrus and the parahippocampal gyrus; the remains of a fissure extending deep into the hippocampus between Ammon&apos;s horn and the dentate gyrus which becomes obliterated during foetal development. [Definition Source: NCIT]</Literal>
