    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/STATO_0000454</IRI>
        <Literal>&quot;Multivariable_MR&quot; refers to a type of magnetic resonance imaging (MRI) technique that uses multiple variables or parameters to reconstruct images of the body, providing more detailed and accurate information about tissue structure and function. [Definition Source: llama3-8b-8192]</Literal>
