        <IRI>http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/STATO_0000549</IRI>
        <Literal>Random_forests is a machine learning ensemble method that combines multiple decision trees to improve the accuracy and robustness of predictions by reducing overfitting and increasing feature importance. [Definition Source: llama3-8b-8192]</Literal>
