        <IRI>http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/STATO_0000559</IRI>
        <Literal>The &quot;Wald test&quot; is a statistical test used to determine whether the null hypothesis of a Poisson distribution can be rejected in favor of an alternative hypothesis. [Definition Source: llama3-8b-8192]</Literal>
