        <IRI>https://uts.nlm.nih.gov/uts/umls/concept/C0032460</IRI>
        <Literal>A complex disorder characterized by infertility, HIRSUTISM; OBESITY; and various menstrual disturbances such as OLIGOMENORRHEA; AMENORRHEA; ANOVULATION. Polycystic ovary syndrome is usually associated with bilateral enlarged ovaries studded with atretic follicles, not with cysts. The term, polycystic ovary, is misleading. [Definition Source: UMLS]</Literal>
